WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.570
&gt;&gt;&gt; NEW REPORTING THIS MORNING,
CNN HAS LEARNED THAT THE U.S. IS

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:07.440
DEVELOPING CONTINGENCY PLANS FOR
POSSIBLE RUSSIAN ESCALATION IN

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.412
ITS WAR IN UKRAINE, INCLUDING
THE POTENTIAL USE OF TACTICAL

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:15.114
NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
ALSO THE POSSIBILITY OF WHAT ONE

00:00:15.114 --> 00:00:18.284
SOURCE DESCRIBED AS A NUCLEAR
DISPLAY, THAT WOULD BE SOMETHING

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:21.488
SHORT OF A NUCLEAR STRIKE,
INCLUDING THE POSSIBILITY OF A

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:24.324
MILITARY STRIKE ON THE
ZAPORIZHZHIA NUCLEAR POWER

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:27.694
PLANT.
JOINING ME NOW TO DISCUSS,

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:32.499
RETIRED BRIGADIER GENERAL MARK
KENNEDY, ALSO FORMER DEPUTY

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:37.036
DIRECTOR FOR PLANS AND STRATEGY
AT U.S. NCOM.

00:00:37.036 --> 00:00:38.805
GOOD TO HAVE YOU ON THIS
MORNING.

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:42.008
&gt;&gt; HI, JIM, HOW ARE YOU?
&gt;&gt; SO THIS SHOWS HOW SERIOUSLY

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.178
THE U.S. IS TAKING THESE RUSSIAN
NUCLEAR THREATS.

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.747
THEY'VE BEEN DEVELOPING
CONTINGENCY PLANS FOR SOME TIME.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:53.887
I WONDER CAN YOU DESCRIBE WHAT
SUCH CONTINGENCY PLANS MIGHT

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:56.990
INVOLVE?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK, FIRST OF ALL,

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:01.227
THERE IS THE PUBLIC FACE OF ALL
OF THIS, WHICH IS HOW WE

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.730
COMMUNICATE TO RUSSIA WHAT WE'RE
PREPARED TO DO AND WHAT WE ARE

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:06.666
NOT PREPARED TO DO.
MY PERSONAL VIEW IS I THINK WE

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:11.437
OUGHT TO BE DELIBERATELY VAGUE
ON WHAT WE ARE PREPARED TO DO.

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:15.074
ANYTIME YOU DRAW A RED LINE,
THAT COMMITS YOU TO A CERTAIN

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:18.611
COURSE OF ACTION.
LOOK, I THINK IT'S FAIRLY SIMPLE

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:22.916
TO LAY DOWN THE OPTIONS, IT
COULD BE THE SOFT SIDE OF IT,

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:26.553
WHICH IS DOUBLING DOWN ON
SANCTIONS, DOUBLING DOWN ON

00:01:26.553 --> 00:01:30.690
EXPORT CONTROLS, RANGING ALL THE
WAY TO A NUCLEAR RESPONSE OF OUR

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:33.526
OWN AND EVERYTHING IN BETWEEN.
&gt;&gt; WOW.

00:01:33.526 --> 00:01:38.231
&gt;&gt; WOULD BE LIKELY THAT THIS
PRESIDENT IS NOT LOOKING AT THE

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:43.269
FAR END OF THAT, SORT OF OF
LOOKING AT A RESPONSE IN KIND,

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:47.607
BUT NOT WITH NUCLEAR WEAPONS.
HARD STRIKES ON RUSSIAN

00:01:47.607 --> 00:01:50.776
FACILITIES INSIDE OF UKRAINE
MOST LIKELY.

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:56.482
&gt;&gt; THAT'S EXACTLY HOW GENERAL
PETRAEUS DESCRIBED IT, HE SAID

00:01:56.482 --> 00:02:01.387
HYPOTHETICALLY AND, AGAIN, HE IS
NOT BASING THIS ON ANY PUBLIC

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:04.224
REVELATION OF INTELLIGENCE, WE
WOULD RESPOND BY LEADING A NATO

00:02:04.224 --> 00:02:07.860
COLLECTIVE EFFORT THAT WOULD
TAKE OUT EVERY RUSSIAN

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:10.930
CONVENTIONAL FORCE THAT WE COULD
SEE AND IDENTIFY ON THE

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.765
BATTLEFIELD IN UKRAINE, ALSO IN
CRIMEA.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:16.402
DOES THAT SOUND LIKE THE
RESPONSE YOU WOULD BE THINKING

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.204
OF?
&gt;&gt; WELL, I CERTAINLY DON'T HAVE

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:21.407
A VOTE IN THE MATTER BUT I THINK
THAT'S CERTAINLY ONE OF THE

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:22.875
OPTIONS THAT WOULD BE
CONSIDERED.

00:02:22.875 --> 00:02:28.348
I'M GLAD TO SEE I'M IN GOOD
COMPANY AS GENERAL PETRAEUS.

00:02:28.348 --> 00:02:32.252
&gt;&gt; THE CONCERN FROM THE START OF
THIS WAR WHICH HAS QUALIFIED

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:35.555
REALLY EVERY U.S. NATO STEP IN
RESPONSE TO THE RUSSIAN

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:39.192
INVASION, THE QUALITY OF
WEAPONS, THE RANGE OF WEAPONS,

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:43.896
THE DEGREE OF MILITARY SUPPORT
FOR UKRAINE HAS BEEN CONCERNS

00:02:43.896 --> 00:02:47.333
ABOUT SPARKING A BROADER WAR
WITH RUSSIA, FOR INSTANCE,

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:51.437
THAT'S WHY THE IDEA OF A NO FLY
ZONE AS ELIMINATED BECAUSE THAT

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:55.208
WOULD BE PUTTING NATO WAR PLANES
IN DIRECT CONFLICT WITH RUSSIAN

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.442
FORCES.
WOULD A RESPONSE LIKE THIS, AND

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:58.778
THIS HAS TO BE PART OF THE
CALCULATION, RIGHT, THERE IS A

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:03.716
RISK OF SPARKING A BROADER WAR,
IS THERE NOT?

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:08.354
&gt;&gt; THERE CERTAINLY IS, BUT I
HEARD A DESCRIPTION OF PUTIN

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.523
YESTERDAY THAT I THOUGHT WAS
PARTICULARLY APT.

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:15.862
HE STARTED OFF AS AN AUTOCRAT,
BECAME A DICTATOR AND NOW HE IS

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:16.896
A MADMAN.
&gt;&gt; WOW.

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:20.466
&gt;&gt; HE MAY BE A MADMAN, BUT I
DON'T THINK HE'S SUICIDAL.

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:24.704
I DON'T BELIEVE THAT HE WANTS TO
BE THE LEADER OF RUSSIA THAT

00:03:24.704 --> 00:03:29.108
ENDS THE RUSSIAN FEDERATION.
SO I THINK WE OUGHT TO TAKE HIS

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:37.283
THREATS SERIOUSLY, BUT I DON'T
THINK WE SHOULD BE COWED OR

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:40.053
COERCE DS IN ANY PARTICULAR
ACTION AS A RESULT.

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:45.291
&gt;&gt; THE U.S. TO DATE HAS NOT
DETECTED ANY MOVEMENTS OF

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:48.227
RUSSIAN NUCLEAR FORCES OR
WEAPONS THAT WOULD INDICATE THE

00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:50.596
ATTACK IS IMMINENT.
I DO WANT TO TALK ABOUT THE

00:03:50.596 --> 00:03:52.231
BATTLEFIELD AND UKRAINIAN
PROGRESS.

00:03:52.231 --> 00:03:55.368
WE SAW THAT RAPID ADVANCE IN THE
NORTHEAST AT THE START OF THIS

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:59.038
COUNTEROFFENSIVE, NOW WE'RE
SEEING IF NOT QUITE RAPID

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:01.974
ADVANCE BUT STILL SUBSTANTIAL
ADVANCE IN THE SOUTH AROUND

00:04:01.974 --> 00:04:04.644
KHERSON.
HOW BAD IS THE SITUATION FOR

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:08.181
RUSSIA AND IT'S FORCES?
HAVE WE SEEN THE BEGINNING OF A

00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:13.886
BROADER RETREAT HERE?
&gt;&gt; THAT'S HARD TO SAY, JIM,

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:18.023
BECAUSE IF YOU LOOK AT IT FROM
CLASSIC MILITARY ANALYSIS, THE

00:04:18.023 --> 00:04:22.328
RUSSIANS SHOULD BE DOING FAR,
FAR BETTER, A QUANTITATIVE

00:04:22.328 --> 00:04:25.264
ASSESSMENT BECAUSE THAT THE
RUSSIANS HAVE THE ADVANTAGE, BUT

00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:28.968
IT'S THE INTANGIBLES THAT WE'RE
SEEING ON THE BATTLEFIELD.

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:32.405
THE MORALE OF THE UKRAINIANS,
THE EQUIPMENT THEY HAVE, THE

00:04:32.405 --> 00:04:35.208
LEADERSHIP THAT THEY HAVE,
VERSUS THE EXACT OPPOSITE ON THE

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:39.379
SIDE OF THE RUSSIANS.
I DON'T THINK YOU CAN TAKE A

00:04:39.379 --> 00:04:43.182
CONVENTIONAL MILITARY RULER AND
MEASURE THIS AS WELL AS MAY HAVE

00:04:43.182 --> 00:04:46.018
BEEN IN THE PAST.
I DON'T PARTICULARLY THINK

00:04:46.018 --> 00:04:49.689
THERE'S GOING TO BE A BREAK OUT
ANYTIME SOON BUT THERE WILL BE

00:04:49.689 --> 00:04:52.625
CONTINUED PRESSURES ON THE
RUSSIANS BOTH IN THE NORTH AND

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:54.694
THE SOUTH.
&gt;&gt; BRIGADIER GENERAL MARK

00:04:54.694 --> 00:04:56.095
KIMMETT, GOOD TO HAVE YOU ON
THIS MORNING.

00:04:56.095 --> 00:04:57.263
THANKS SO MUCH.
"THE NEW YORK TIMES" REPORTING

00:04:57.263 --> 00:05:01.400
THIS, A RANGE OF OFFICIALS
SUGGESTED THAT IF RUSSIA

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:08.341
DETONATED A NUCLEAR WEAPON ON
UKRAINIAN SOIL, THE OPTIONS ARE

00:05:08.341 --> 00:05:14.046
UNPLUGGING RUSSIA FROM THE WORLD
ECONOMY OR A MILITARY RESPONSE.

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:17.550
JOINING US NOW ONE OF THE
REPORTERS BEHIND THE STORY, CNN

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:20.787
POLITICAL AND NATIONAL SECURITY
ANALYST DAVID SINGER.

00:05:20.787 --> 00:05:23.790
THIS IS SUCH A GREAT STORY I
THINK BECAUSE IT PUTS US IN THE

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:27.994
MOMENT WE'RE IN, WHICH IS KIND
OF AN ALARMING ONE, ALTHOUGH YOU

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:30.663
DO POINT OUT, FOR INSTANCE,
THERE ARE SOME REASONS WHY

00:05:30.663 --> 00:05:36.369
SENIOR OFFICIALS ARE SAYING NOT
TO BE FULLY CONCERNED AT THIS

00:05:36.369 --> 00:05:38.905
POINT IN TIME.
BUT PUT IN CONTEXT WHERE WE ARE.

00:05:38.905 --> 00:05:43.476
&gt;&gt; I THINK WHERE WE ARE, THIS IS
PROBABLY ONE OF THE MOST FRAUGHT

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:47.413
NUCLEAR MOMENTS SINCE THE CUBAN
MISSILE CRISIS WHICH WAS 60

00:05:47.413 --> 00:05:49.882
YEARS AGO THIS MONTH.
THAT SAID, THERE'S NO EVIDENCE

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:55.021
RIGHT NOW THAT WE SEE THE
RUSSIANS MOVING ANY TACTICAL

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.489
WEAPONS.
THEY'RE SMALL SO IT MIGHT BE

00:05:56.489 --> 00:06:01.627
EASY TO MISS THEM, BUT THERE'S
NO EVIDENCE OF THAT AT THIS

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:02.595
POINT.
AND THEY DON'T BELIEVE THAT

00:06:02.595 --> 00:06:05.364
PUTIN YET HAS HIS BACK SO UP
AGAINST THE WALL THAT HE WOULD

00:06:05.364 --> 00:06:08.901
TURN TO THIS.
IT'S ALSO NOT ENTIRELY CLEAR HOW

00:06:08.901 --> 00:06:12.939
MUCH USING A TACTICAL WEAPON
WOULD HELP HIM ON THE

00:06:12.939 --> 00:06:16.576
BATTLEFIELD.
EXCEPT TO TRY TO FREEZE THINGS.

00:06:16.576 --> 00:06:20.613
TO SAY TO THE UKRAINIANS IF YOU
MAKE ONE MORE MOVE TOWARD

00:06:20.613 --> 00:06:24.183
THROWING US OUT OF THE DONBAS OR
THESE OTHER AREAS, JUST KNOW

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:28.488
THAT I CAN TAKE OUT YOUR ENTIRE
COUNTRY AND TURN IT ALL INTO

00:06:28.488 --> 00:06:30.723
WASTE LAND.
BUT THE CONSEQUENCES FOR PUTIN

00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:34.193
WOULD BE HIGH.
&gt;&gt; SURELY PUTIN KNOWS AMONG

00:06:34.193 --> 00:06:39.365
THOSE CONVENTIONS WOULD BE
GLOBAL CONDEMNATION.

00:06:39.365 --> 00:06:42.468
THERE ARE STILL SOME COUNTRIES
THAT HE HAS SOMEWHAT ON HIS

00:06:42.468 --> 00:06:45.471
SIDE, INCLUDING CHINA.
HE MUST KNOW THAT HE WOULD VERY

00:06:45.471 --> 00:06:48.474
QUICKLY LOSE THAT SUPPORT IF HE
WERE TO DO ANYTHING ON THE

00:06:48.474 --> 00:06:51.010
NUCLEAR FRONT.
&gt;&gt; I THINK THAT'S RIGHT.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:57.683
I DON'T THINK HE WOULD.
AND CHINA AND INDIA ARE TWO

00:06:57.683 --> 00:07:01.387
COUNTRIES THAT ARE CONTINUING TO
BUY OIL, FOR EXAMPLE, AND NOT

00:07:01.387 --> 00:07:03.589
PART OF THE MAJOR SANCTIONS
REGIME.

00:07:03.589 --> 00:07:07.260
AT THE SAME TIME WHAT WORRIES
MOST AMERICAN OFFICIALS IS WHAT

00:07:07.260 --> 00:07:10.329
HAPPENS WHEN PUTIN COMES TO THE
CONCLUSION THAT THE WAR IS GOING

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:17.837
SO BADLY IT'S A THREAT TO NOT
ONLY RUSSIA BUT TO HIM.

00:07:17.837 --> 00:07:21.641
AND AT THAT MOMENT HE MAY REACH
FOR WHATEVER HE'S GOT.

00:07:21.641 --> 00:07:26.612
HE MAY ALSO THINK THAT OVER TIME
OTHER COUNTRIES HAVE BROKEN

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:31.517
TABOOS AND GOTTEN AWAY WITH IT.
NOTICE IN THE SPEECH THE FIRST

00:07:31.517 --> 00:07:38.858
THING -- THE ONE LAST WEEK, THE
FIRST THING HE SAID THERE WAS

00:07:38.858 --> 00:07:42.328
HIROSHIMA, NAGASAKI AND YOU SET
A PRECEDENCE WHEN YOU DID THAT.

00:07:42.328 --> 00:07:45.731
&gt;&gt; THAT'S PART OF HIS CAMPAIGN
OF RATIONALIZATION.

00:07:45.731 --> 00:07:49.702
SAYING THEY SET THE PRECEDENT.
THE U.S. SET THE PRECEDENT.

00:07:49.702 --> 00:07:54.740
HE'S ALSO ON THE RATIONALIZATION
HAD THESE ILLEGAL ANNEXATIONS OF

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.878
THESE FOUR AREAS OF UKRAINE.
AND WHEN YOU LOOK AT RUSSIAN

00:07:58.878 --> 00:08:03.416
MILITARY DOCTRINE.
AND HE KEEPS RE-EMPHASIZING THIS

00:08:03.416 --> 00:08:07.687
AS HAVE OTHER OFFICIALS, NUCLEAR
WEAPONS CAN BE USED IF THERE IS

00:08:07.687 --> 00:08:14.927
AN EXISTENTIAL THREAT TO RUSSIA
NOW IT SEEMS THE RATIONALIZATION

00:08:14.927 --> 00:08:18.898
IS THIS IS RUSSIA, IF YOU GO
AFTER THIS, WE CAN USE A NUKE.

00:08:18.898 --> 00:08:23.903
&gt;&gt; THAT IS THE BACKWARDS
RATIONA

00:08:23.903 --> 00:08:25.438
RATIONALIZATION.
IT WOULD ALSO SEEM TO APPLY TO

00:08:25.438 --> 00:08:30.142
CRIMEA, WE'VE SEEN THE
UKRAINIANS ATTACK CRIMEA AND

00:08:30.142 --> 00:08:32.411
HE'S NOT REACHED FOR NUCLEAR
WEAPONS.

00:08:32.411 --> 00:08:36.349
THE ODDITY IS NUCLEAR WEAPONS
ARE ONE OF THOSE THINGS THAT ARE

00:08:36.349 --> 00:08:38.551
MUCH MORE POWERFUL IN THE
PERSPECTIVE.

00:08:38.551 --> 00:08:41.120
IN THE THREAT THAT YOU MIGHT USE
IT.

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:43.689
THAN THEY ARE WHEN YOU ACTUALLY
GO OFF TO USE IT.

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:48.194
THIS IS NOT LIKE THE OLD COLD
WAR DAYS WHERE THE CONCERN WAS

00:08:48.194 --> 00:08:53.065
THEY WOULD LOB A NUCLEAR WEAPON
AT THE UNITED STATES, IN RETURN

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:55.635
FOR NEW YORK YOU TAKE OUT MOSCOW
OR WHATEVER.

00:08:55.635 --> 00:08:58.804
IN THIS CASE HE'S TALKING ABOUT
USING A SMALL WEAPON THAT WOULD

00:08:58.804 --> 00:09:04.076
BE USED ON PRESUMABLY A MILITARY
BASE, MAYBE A LOW POPULATED

00:09:04.076 --> 00:09:06.478
AREA.
THE WEST IS NOT GOING TO FIRE A

00:09:06.478 --> 00:09:08.481
NUCLEAR WEAPON BACK IN RETURN
FOR THAT.

00:09:08.481 --> 00:09:12.752
THEY MAY ACTUALLY, AS WE
REPORTED, USE CONVENTIONAL

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.153
WEAPONS.
THERE COULD BE SOME KIND OF

00:09:14.153 --> 00:09:17.156
MILITARY RESPONSE BUT NOT A
NUCLEAR RESPONSE.

00:09:17.156 --> 00:09:21.327
SO HE MAY WELL THINK THAT, YOU
KNOW, OVER TIME HE WOULD GET

00:09:21.327 --> 00:09:25.731
AWAY WITH THIS.
HE THINKS OVER TIME THE WEST IS

00:09:25.731 --> 00:09:27.700
GOING TO LOSE INTEREST IN
UKRAINE.

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:32.071
AS THE WINTER SETS IN EUROPE,
THE INTEREST IN CONTINUING THE

00:09:32.071 --> 00:09:38.144
SANCTIONS IS GOING TO DIMINISH.
WE'VE SEEN PROTESTS IN EUROPE

00:09:38.144 --> 00:09:43.015
ABOUT HIGH PRICES AND SHORTAGES.
HE'S BETTING WE'LL LOSE

